    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hey, I’m Connor: a product-minded software engineer with experience across a wide range of technologies. I studied Electrical and Computer Engineering at Carnegie Mellon, and since then I’ve pretty much lived in the startup world. I’ve worked at companies across the whole spectrum — a tiny founding team, fast-growing seed and Series A startups, and a Series D unicorn that became one of the fastest-growing digital health companies ever. The pace was chaotic at times, but I’ve always found the energy of startups exhilarating and enjoyed building things from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
